  "description": "<p>If your authentication principal does not have at least one of fedoraUser or fedoraAdmin roles the system tries to add an empty set of roles and Shiro explodes.</p>\n\n<p>Need a check for empty around this line.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-5.0.0-RC-2/fcrepo-auth-common/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/common/ServletContainerAuthenticatingRealm.java#L51\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-5.0.0-RC-2/fcrepo-auth-common/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/common/ServletContainerAuthenticatingRealm.java#L51</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>",
